    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TraceRoot Signal Pipeline v2\n\nAdds an enrichment + draft-outreach layer on top of the v1 signal discovery pipeline, structurally inspired by the community template \"Automate lead generation & personalized outreach with Apollo, AI, and Instantly.ai\" (n8n.io/workflows/6983), adapted for signal-based discovery instead of generic Apollo prospecting.\n\nFlow:\n1. Discover: same as v1, Linkup search + Claude classifier for real, confirmed agent-debugging pain.\n2. Enrich: a second Linkup call pulls factual background on the potential champion and one recent company data point, no speculation.\n3. Draft: Claude writes a short, specific outreach draft using only the confirmed pain + enrichment, explicitly labeled as a draft.\n4. Human review: Google Sheets row status defaults to \"Awaiting review\", Slack message shows the full draft inline, nothing sends automatically.\n\nThis intentionally stops short of auto-sending. A human decides whether each draft is good enough to send, same standard as everything built by hand today.\n\nSwitched from Airtable to Google Sheets on purpose: fully free with no tier limits at this volume, native n8n node, and a status column filters just as easily in a spreadsheet.\n\nTO ACTIVATE: create a Google Sheet with column headers matching the Store in Google Sheets node (Team or Project, Pain Summary, Potential Champion, Enrichment, Draft Message, Source URL, Confidence, Status), connect a Google account credential, paste the Sheet ID and tab name into the node, swap in real Linkup/Slack/Anthropic credentials, then run manually once before leaving on schedule.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 500
      },
